This product is an unofficial Flutter port of the Coinbase Design System
(CDS). It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Coinbase, Inc.
"Coinbase" is a trademark of Coinbase, Inc.; this package uses the name only
to describe what it is a port of. The Apache License does not grant
permission to use Coinbase trade names, trademarks, or logos.

This product includes software and assets derived from the Coinbase Design
System (https://github.com/coinbase/cds), Copyright 2026 Coinbase, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  * Color spectrum and semantic color values, spacing, radius, border, icon,
    avatar, control-size and typography scales, motion curves and durations,
    and component dimensions (ported from packages/common and packages/mobile).
  * The CDS icon font (packages/icons/src/fonts/native/CoinbaseIcons.ttf),
    redistributed as assets/fonts/CdsIcons.ttf, and its glyph and description
    maps, converted to Dart by tool/generate_icons.dart.
  * Interaction color blending (getBlendedColor) and component behavior,
    re-implemented in Dart.

Changes from the original: all code was rewritten in Dart for Flutter; the
icon font file was renamed, its layout tables were dropped, and the brand
marks listed in tool/excluded_icons.txt (Coinbase, Base, Coinbase Wallet and
third-party logos) were removed from it by tool/subset_icon_font.py; logo,
wordmark and sub-brand components and the proprietary Coinbase Sans, Display,
Text and Mono fonts were not included.

